msgctxt "112"
msgid "I'll take the first shot, if you don't mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Be my guest."
msgstr "Faccia con comodo."

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Hey, you're pretty good."
msgstr "Ehi, sei mica male."

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure I'd go that far. The wind's just been blowing\r\n"
"in my favor today, that's all. Do you golf often, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Not really, no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Ah. Well, practice makes perfect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Wow, Kiryu-san! Your form is fantastic!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Me? I don't think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Haha, no need to be modest. You're a natural."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Shall we head to the next hole?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Mi sembra una buona idea."

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Think I hit it a little too hard..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, that happens to everyone when they're first\r\n"
"starting out. All you need is some more practice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Now, shall we head to the next hole?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Certo."

